            <field name="revision">Revision: 00</field>
            <field name="duration_basis">Audit time: Stage 1 + Stage 2 (days)</field>
            <field name="duration_intro">Calculation of M/D for the initial certification audit according to the Information technology service management - Requirements for bodies providing audit and certification of IT service management systems is based on the values shown in the table below.</field>
            <field name="annex_filename">VB-BA-ZET-MS-All-003-Ann-MDC-20000-EN.docx</field>
