            <field name="time_chart_image" type="base64" file="tuv_md_calculation/static/annexes/iso_20000_auditor_time_chart.png"/>
            <field name="multi_site_note">In case of multi site organizations, a representative number of sites have been sampled taking into account:
- Operating under the same SMS, which is certainly administrated
- Included within the client's internal audit programme
- Included within the client's management review programme</field>
        </record>

